# Radio page tour (listening). Demo mode, and the launch default AutoradioDemoSheet = day (defaults write news.choir.autoradio.lab AutoradioDemoSheet day),
# which loads fixtures/demo/runsheet-day.json as the run sheet and keeps the station from starting by itself. @S@ is the shots directory.
# Best effort: Listening is driven by the engine's phase (a scripted turn through the Components page); no file can set it.
clock data
clock +1500 real
clock data
tap bar-mark
clock +600 real
tap place-components
clock +800 real
clock data
tap stage-addressing-hybrid
tap stage-transcriber-scripted
tap stage-system1-fixed
tap stage-holder-local-ack
tap stage-desk-stub-echo
tap stage-programme-fixture
tap ack-immediate
clock data
tap start
clock +1500 real
clock data
tap bar-mark
clock +600 real
tap "launcher-open-radio:"
clock +900 real
clock data
tap inject
clock +700 real
clock data
tree
screenshot @S@/E01-listening-a.png window
clock +1000 real
tree
screenshot @S@/E02-listening-b.png window
clock +2500 real
clock data
tree
screenshot @S@/E03-after-turn.png window
